    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fumo&quot; is a 3D MMORPG with the theme of Eastern Immortal Heroes. The game is set in &quot;Fengshen Yanyi&quot; as the story background, showcasing the increasingly fierce struggle between Buddhism, demons, and Taoism in the human world 1500 years after being Fengshen. It showcases the story of once again creating a new world after the escalating disputes between the mortal world, the immortal, demonic, and divine realms in the human world! The combination of beautiful Chinese painting style and ancient epics creates a magnificent and imaginative painting scroll for players.</p>",
